                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e8ca528b-acd8-3d9c-a2bd-40e9ea09ff95",
                        "entry_id": "2a6a8755-77b4-38f3-adc8-2033861b59cd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "повернуться и посмотреть назад или в сторону"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "154c6618-b713-4785-81bb-cb68bebc01c2",
                                "sense_id": "e8ca528b-acd8-3d9c-a2bd-40e9ea09ff95",
                                "text": "Жизнь быстро летит: оглянешься — а ты уже старик."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9e4298fa-bb5c-4609-ad0f-31f590911cd0",
                        "source_entry_id": "2a6a8755-77b4-38f3-adc8-2033861b59cd",
                        "source_sense_id": "e8ca528b-acd8-3d9c-a2bd-40e9ea09ff95",
                        "target_lang_word": "look back",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "look back",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a75c96e0-7bfe-3bfa-8a15-6732c87180be",
                                        "entry_id": "39b494cb-2785-3c9f-aa89-f67022780b5d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used other than figuratively or idiomatically: see look, back."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dcecc5b7-f910-41f9-81ae-552e3aa53adb",
                                                "sense_id": "a75c96e0-7bfe-3bfa-8a15-6732c87180be",
                                                "text": "Don't look back in anger, I heard you say"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b7635154-5805-38bf-8080-529428c06808",
                                        "entry_id": "39b494cb-2785-3c9f-aa89-f67022780b5d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To think of (past events) in retrospect."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10493e39-a02b-4992-9e74-ecf7cac117fa",
                                                "sense_id": "b7635154-5805-38bf-8080-529428c06808",
                                                "text": "When I look back at my summer holidays as a child, I smile."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a0af59f-92a2-4b81-a9d3-4e856f7dec27",
                                                "sense_id": "b7635154-5805-38bf-8080-529428c06808",
                                                "text": "I can't tell you what you're feelin' inside / And I can't sell you what you don't want to buy / Something's missing, you got to look back on your life / You know something here just ain't right"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "488b5deb-7cb7-4bc4-876e-668bc96bb298",
                                                "sense_id": "b7635154-5805-38bf-8080-529428c06808",
                                                "text": "United were made to pay for letting an eight-point lead as little as five weeks ago slip and, despite their final-day efforts, they will look back on a season where, when they needed to step up, they fell flat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88307104-022d-4fba-b632-59a1f5bd380f",
                                                "sense_id": "b7635154-5805-38bf-8080-529428c06808",
                                                "text": "For Crossrail 2, people on this project a few years ago hoped they would move directly on to that. \"Obviously, politics and money haven't come together in the same way as they did for Crossrail 1, but I've said to the team that if you look back at everything from HS1 and the Channel Tunnel, these things always happen... but the question is timing. […] \"The Jubilee Line is another one. It seems very unlikely, with these transformational things, that people will look back in a few decades' time and think we shouldn't have built it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1fa39d25-a400-30d8-a3cd-7e9394f74523",
                                        "entry_id": "39b494cb-2785-3c9f-aa89-f67022780b5d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To reconsider or regret."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6107ca8-eff2-4fd0-aae1-a2f2fbe14877",
                                                "sense_id": "1fa39d25-a400-30d8-a3cd-7e9394f74523",
                                                "text": "You do what you have to do, and don't look back."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "look back",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8e7f22f1-3e1e-34fe-a165-c36e24a4d88a",
                                        "entry_id": "5d682de6-e264-3581-9d9e-c5c82ad93c17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of look-back."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5b68df1e-eadb-40b0-9dc0-010ad3e3c13d",
                        "source_entry_id": "2a6a8755-77b4-38f3-adc8-2033861b59cd",
                        "source_sense_id": "e8ca528b-acd8-3d9c-a2bd-40e9ea09ff95",
                        "target_lang_word": "look around",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "look around",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d730488d-f4f6-39de-8df0-f868cba6426e",
                                        "entry_id": "a23afc3d-3f13-37c2-93b2-cf7a2c0eac93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To inspect a building or area."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7335107-e451-48e3-90fa-e9fb6b619b60",
                                                "sense_id": "d730488d-f4f6-39de-8df0-f868cba6426e",
                                                "text": "We're interested in buying this house. Can we look around tomorrow?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "868ce77b-83fa-3f7a-bed4-98e7656b158c",
                                        "entry_id": "a23afc3d-3f13-37c2-93b2-cf7a2c0eac93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To search a place."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee4586b5-dd12-4591-9c0e-de31550c7d40",
                                                "sense_id": "868ce77b-83fa-3f7a-bed4-98e7656b158c",
                                                "text": "I can't find my keys, so I'll look around."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4fe32246-df2f-3cbb-af1b-abb3616b7e2c",
                                        "entry_id": "a23afc3d-3f13-37c2-93b2-cf7a2c0eac93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To turn one's head to see what is behind oneself."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "190939c2-9979-4066-95f3-3c1d2b520fb0",
                                                "sense_id": "4fe32246-df2f-3cbb-af1b-abb3616b7e2c",
                                                "text": "He heard a voice and looked around to see a man wearing dark clothes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab59f04e-3003-3dcc-abad-3b9d50f20103",
                                        "entry_id": "a23afc3d-3f13-37c2-93b2-cf7a2c0eac93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To take note of what is going on; to make oneself aware."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a82177e7-d402-4086-a3ca-7959b2c9d8ae",
                                                "sense_id": "ab59f04e-3003-3dcc-abad-3b9d50f20103",
                                                "text": "Sure enough, when Jon appeals to centuries-old tradition binding the families of the north together, it comes off as good-hearted but short-sighted. Look around, Jon. It’s a new day. Queens rule the continent. They might rule the North, too, if tradition hadn’t made room for a bastard king. At a certain point, adhering to tradition becomes a failure to adapt. It traps people in the same deepening grooves of history their parents died in."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "78393e20-fd93-3186-a908-7cff2348d4ae",
                                        "entry_id": "a23afc3d-3f13-37c2-93b2-cf7a2c0eac93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used other than figuratively or idiomatically: see look, around."
